  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00741",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "是啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yes, that was it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00741",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "当时我被美所包围，确实是落在美境中。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At that time I was surrounded by beauty; I had indeed fallen into a realm of beauty.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00741",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "然而我怀疑：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yet I wondered:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00741",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "倘使不是在无休止地猛刮的凶暴的风的意志支撑下，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "if I had not been sustained by the will of that savage wind blowing furiously without end,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00741",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "我能那样万全地被美所包围吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "could I have been so completely surrounded by beauty?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00741",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "正像柏木叱责我\"结巴！结巴\"那样，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Just as Kashiwagi had scolded me, \"Stutterer! Stutterer!\",",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00741",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "我也尝试着鞭答风，呼唤出鼓励骏马的话语：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I too tried to whip the wind, calling out words used to urge on a swift horse:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
